OL,3,GNEWSALarge fire at former power station
OL,4,
OL,5,FFirefighters are tackling a large fire
OL,6,Fat a former power station in Cheshire.
OL,8,FCheshire Fire and Rescue Service (CFRS)
OL,9,Fwas called to an industrial unit at
OL,10,FFiddlers Ferry Power Station, near
OL,11,FWarrington, at 12:58 BST.
OL,13,FCrews from 11 stations across Cheshire
OL,14,Fare at the scene, with road closures
OL,15,Fand a cordon in place.
OL,17,FResidents living nearby have been
OL,18,Fadvised to keep their windows and doors
OL,19,Fclosed because of the smoke.
